ys. Biromantic asexuals seek romantic relationships for companionship, affection, and intimacy, but they are not sexually attracted to their romantic partners\",\"Active\":true,\"ReadOnly\":false,\"CreatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"CreatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\",\"UpdatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"UpdatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\"},{\"Name\":\"Bisexuality\",\"Description\":\"Bisexuals are sexually attracted to two or more Sexualitys\",\"Active\":true,\"ReadOnly\":false,\"CreatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"CreatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\",\"UpdatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"UpdatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\"},{\"Name\":\"Ceterosexual\",\"Description\":\"Someone who experiences sexual/romantic attraction only to non-binary people. This label is used as a non-problematic term for skoliosexuality only to be used by non-binary people\",\"Active\":true,\"ReadOnly\":false,\"CreatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"CreatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\",\"UpdatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"UpdatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\"},{\"Name\":\"Demisexual\",\"Description\":\"Demisexual refers to a person who doesn\\u2019t experience sexual attraction unless they form an emotional connection\",\"Active\":true,\"ReadOnly\":false,\"CreatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"CreatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\",\"UpdatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"UpdatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\"},{\"Name\":\"Demiromantic\",\"Description\":\"This term is a type of grey-romantic who only experiences romantic attraction after developing an emotional connection. They do not experience primary romantic attraction, but are capable of secondary romantic attraction\",\"Active\":true,\"ReadOnly\":false,\"CreatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"CreatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\",\"UpdatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"UpdatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\"},{\"Name\":\"Finsexual\",\"Description\":\"The attraction to women, females and femininity \",\"Active\":true,\"ReadOnly\":false,\"CreatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"CreatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\",\"UpdatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"UpdatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\"},{\"Name\":\"Gay\",\"Description\":\"A person who identifies as homosexual\",\"Active\":true,\"ReadOnly\":false,\"CreatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"CreatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\",\"UpdatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"UpdatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\"},{\"Name\":\"Gynosexual\",\"Description\":\"Anyone who has sexual feelings towards a woman or femininity. The term can be useful when describing the sexual orientation of an individual with a non-binary Sexuality identity\",\"Active\":true,\"ReadOnly\":false,\"CreatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"CreatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\",\"UpdatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"UpdatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\"},{\"Name\":\"Grey-Romantic\",\"Description\":\"A grey-romantic is a person with a romantic orientation that is somewhere between aromantic \\u0026 romantic\",\"Active\":true,\"ReadOnly\":false,\"CreatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"CreatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\",\"UpdatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"UpdatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\"},{\"Name\":\"Heterosexual\",\"Description\":\"A person sexually attracted to people of the opposite sex\",\"Active\":true,\"ReadOnly\":false,\"CreatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"CreatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\",\"UpdatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"UpdatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\"},{\"Name\":\"Homosexuality\",\"Description\":\"A person sexually attracted to people of ones own sex\",\"Active\":true,\"ReadOnly\":false,\"CreatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"CreatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\",\"UpdatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"UpdatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\"},{\"Name\":\"Heteroromantic\",\"Description\":\"Romantically attracted to a member of the opposite sex or Sexuality. They may seek romantic intimacy but they\\u2019re not sexually attracted to partners\",\"Active\":true,\"ReadOnly\":false,\"CreatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"CreatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\",\"UpdatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00: